REPLACE THIS FILE WITH: theme_frame_inactive.png
- Role   : Frame when the Chrome window loses focus
- Size   : 2500 × 200 px  (same as theme_frame)
- Format : PNG-24
- Tips   : Usually a desaturated or darkened version of theme_frame.
           You can omit this key in manifest.json to let Chrome apply
           its default fading effect to theme_frame instead.
